      "writtenOn": "2022-03-01T12:15:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will update commit text why we need to disable it and explain memory footprint issue in next patchset.\n\nAs mentioned in bug, in our platform, more than 80+ cooling devices are there and internal slab memory consumption breakup shows that this feature is consuming  around 18.5MB memory and it is more critical for target variants with lower DDR memory config. We are looking for a way for vendor to disable this debugging feature for low DDR memory target variant.",
      "parentUuid": "81eff9cc_aa9a612b",
      "revId": "243f6f183fa689d9212624592b8f4d203d4aaca3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
